    <preface>
      <p>Health Legislation Amendment (Removal of Requirement for a Collaborative Arrangement) Act 2024</p>
      <p>No. 33, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to health, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Health Insurance Act 1973	3</p>
